                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d82c7cc9-c4f5-3596-bfbe-5ca34dfc2d14",
                                        "entry_id": "0cfc9b60-37bf-313a-ae67-675f1152bf0b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A risky investment or other venture."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b312b469-1cc7-46d7-ab2a-83ee842c6b92",
                                                "sense_id": "d82c7cc9-c4f5-3596-bfbe-5ca34dfc2d14",
                                                "text": "It was a great day for the pair of Fosters. They were speechless for joy. Also speechless for another reason: after much watching of the market, Aleck had lately, with fear and trembling, made her first flyer on a “margin,” using the remaining twenty thousand of the bequest in this risk."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "592f253a-de11-3582-b8a8-f8bc82a018e2",
                                        "entry_id": "0cfc9b60-37bf-313a-ae67-675f1152bf0b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fast-moving person or thing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1982b42-119c-491d-a43f-26e2ac2e08d5",
                                                "sense_id": "592f253a-de11-3582-b8a8-f8bc82a018e2",
                                                "text": "An amusing incident on the first of these journeys was the checking by signal of the flyer about 3 miles out of Paris, with the result that it was overhauled by the 6.25 p.m. semi-fast from Paris to Montargis, to the unconcealed delight of passengers in the latter."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3725e96-107c-418a-892d-e12c7f37b117",
                                                "sense_id": "592f253a-de11-3582-b8a8-f8bc82a018e2",
                                                "text": "The new Waterloo–Exeter times of the S.R. flyer are 2hr 58min down and 1min more up, in less than 3hr, that is to say, in both directions, with the help of four runs timed at over a mile a minute."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df2c0887-7008-3cd1-b4a1-771170b9dd87",
                                        "entry_id": "0cfc9b60-37bf-313a-ae67-675f1152bf0b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A false start"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "09b0e31a-7f90-3899-a399-3516d4d51356",
                                        "entry_id": "0cfc9b60-37bf-313a-ae67-675f1152bf0b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of flying cymbal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
