                                                "sense_id": "2a3dc928-52ea-3e40-ac9b-6bb0b1c6e0d3",
                                                "text": "Neil McKinnon, the Fringe's head of external affairs, asks: Are you flyering in the right place at the right time? How are you flyering? Good flyering is about more than standing there handing out flyers to as many people as you can."
                                            }
